:: Thomas Hang Out End Late High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> are in the middle of an actually pretty riveting conversation when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> has a moment of realization. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Shit, do you have the time?”</span> You tell him the time and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> curses under his breath and sighs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I gotta run. I have a job tonight and I can’t be late. Fuck, can’t believe I lost track of time like that.”</span> You apologize for distracting him so much, if you remembered he had to leave at a certain time you would have reminded him.<br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
        Name: "Thomas",
        State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Mouth: "Happy",
            Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No worries.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> replies with a slight chuckle, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I shouldn’t be late if I leave now. Plus, I surprisingly enjoyed myself.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">pauses for a moment; you can tell he wants to stay and was having one of his rare good times.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Ask him to stay out a little longer<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> if there is anyway he can skip his job for tonight and hang out with you a bit more. Afterall, you both are having fun and he deserves a break every now and again with how hard he works. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> turns to you, pausing briefly, before sighing, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, I can’t. This isn’t the type of job I can just skip out on. Plus, we need the money so…”</span> He pauses before smirking, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But we should do this again. You’re not as annoying as most kids our age.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">You smile back at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> and bid him farewell, watching as the boy hurries off into the distance before disappearing.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>

	<<link "Ask him for a hug goodbye<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You sigh as well, claiming that you wish he could stay, but understand he has to go. But, if it isn’t too much trouble, you would like one thing before he runs off. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> pauses and turns to you with a raised eyebrow. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What?”</span> You stretch your arms out and ask for a hug goodbye.<br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Thomas",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wha-!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> stutters out, blushing slightly. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Why would I-?”</span> You take a step towards him and smile. <span style="color:Pink">All you want is a simple hug, it’s not a big deal, right? <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span>’ eye twitches slightly and he glances around before sighing.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fine! But this better not become a habit.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> leans forward and gives you a very awkward, very light, hug. You squeeze him a little tighter to give it some flair, but he quickly rips himself free. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“There! Now, I gotta go… but I’ll see you later.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He gives one last smirk before running off.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>